OL,3,GNEWSASunshine and showers greet
OL,4,Aautumn's arrival
OL,5,
OL,6,FAs the calendar ticks past astronomical
OL,7,Fautumn, the weather has brought showers
OL,8,Fand a nip in the air along with the
OL,9,Fsunshine to show the seasons have well
OL,10,Fand truly changed.
OL,12,FAs always, our BBC Weather Watchers
OL,13,Fhave been out and about capturing the
OL,14,Fscenes cross north-east England and
OL,15,FCumbria.
OL,17,FHere are some of our favourite snaps.
OL,19,FFind out how to join in with Weather
OL,20,FWatchers here. Or send your photos to
OL,21,FLook North.
